        "synopsis": "A girl wrapped in white, her name is Momo...in her hand lies a blunt yet shiny scythe. By her side is a winged black cat by the name of Daniel. Carrying the souls of humans, the girl's existence parallels to that of a \"Death God\" or \"Shinigami\". At the instant when this white Death God touches the hearts of humans, the world is filled with kindness and grief... \n\n(Source: ANN)",
